# Mutations nothing in lingo notices. Measured 2026-09-26 over 4163 points,
# all seven operators. 822 of them, over 3609 points; 77% were caught.
#
# lib/ocaml is in, as of 2026-10-01. Its emitters run under a dune rule at
# build time, when no mutant is selected, so the modules they write were out of
# reach and all 510 points read as survivors. Four laws now ask the emitter for
# its own module again in their own process and compare the bytes, which is
# law_parse (e), law_lex (f), law_format (c) and law_ahead (c). 536 of 551 die.
#
# Each line is a change you could make to that line today with no test
# objecting.  file:line  operator  the edit

